# This is a bingo card definition file for the Bingorat program

# Lines starting with `#` are comments, they will be ignored by the program
# Empty lines are also ignored, they are just for better readability
# The file must contain the following fields: size, name, win, and a list of bingo cells

# specifies the bingo size of 3 or 5
size: 5

# name of the bingo, will be shown in the title
title: Bingo of 2026

# message shown when the user wins
win_message: What a fucked up year, huh?

# list of bingo cells
# must be exactly size^2
# `-` is unnmarked cell, `*` is marked cell
- Survelliance enforced on HW level
- Chat Control gets mandatory
- UK doubles down on full 1984 and tracks everyone everywhere
- Trump declares US independence, leaves NATO and UN
- Unexpected backup of major video streaming service
- Major game studio officially supports Linux first
- GPU prices hit over $10k
- Trump gets Kirked
- Military conflict triggered by satellite malfunction
- Country admits election results were AI-assisted
- Disney+ cancelled due to AI slop
- WW3 starts
# FREE cell, if wanted, must be exactly in the middle of the board, i.e. at index size^2/2
* FREE
- City loses power for multiple day due to software update
- Squadron 42 release
- Nuclear weapon gets lost
- A typo causes billions in damage
- Unpatchable vulnerability found in critical software
- Windows 11 flops, 2026 true year of Linux
- New pandemic sweeps the world
- Social media introduces GLOBAL mandatory age verification
- AI-generated evidence is accepted in court
- Country replaces entire goverment with AI
- Half-Life 3 announced
- China 'temporarily safeguards' Russian strategic assets
